"tomarkirin"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:573
msgid ""
"<p>These options allow you to have the File Selector automatically change "
"location to the directory of the active document on certain events."
"<p>Auto synchronization is <em>lazy</em>, meaning it will not take effect "
"until the file selector is visible."
"<p>None of these are enabled by default, but you can always sync the "
"location by pressing the sync button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"Ev Option biriyar dide, ku kengî divê bête biguhre ser Doseyên, ya ku "
"neha(êsta) Dokumenta aktîv tê deye."
"<p>"
"Sykrona automatik ya \"Sersar\", yanî wê guhertin wê çaxê çê bibe, "
"dema ku hilbijêrê faîl bête xuya kirin. "
"<p>u ne yek Option ji ber xwe ve pêketîye. tu kari Synchroniization bi "
"destê xwe çêbike, heger tu pê li mişkoka nukirinê ya di seko de bike."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:581
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is enabled (default), the location will be restored when "
"you start Kate."
"<p><strong>Note</strong> that if the session is handled by the KDE session "
"manager, the location is always restored."
msgstr ""
"<p>Heger ev option pêkettî be (ew bi xwe ji Standard wissa ye), wê ew "
"navnîşana ya tu paşî li ser bu bixwe vebbe, dema ku tu Kate start "
"bike."
"<p><strong>Agehdarî</strong>: Heger session ya te KDE-Manager bi kar tîne "
"wê evaya automatik bête pêxistin heger te wê saz jî neke."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:585
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is enabled (default), the current filter will be restored "
"when you start Kate."
"<p><strong>Note</strong> that if the session is handled by the KDE session "
"manager, the filter is always restored."
"<p><strong>Note</strong>"
" that some of the autosync settings may override the restored location if on."
msgstr ""
"<p>Heger ev option pêkettî be (ew bi xwe ji Standard wissa ye), wê ew "
"Filtera ya tu paşî li ser bu jiberxwe ve pêkeve, dema ku tu Kate start "
"bike."
"<p><strong>Agehdarî</strong>: Heger session ya te KDE-Manager bi kar tîne "
"wê evaya(Filterê paşî hate bi karînan) jiberxwe ve bête pêxistin û "
"heger te wê saz jî neke."
"<p><strong>ji pêvî wê jî agehdar be</strong>: hinek dananên autosync "
"belkî li navnîşanên çuwî careka dî binîvise."

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "&Project"
msgstr "&Projekt"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "&Document"
msgstr "D&okumênt"

#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>Kate comes with a nice set of plugins, providing simple\n"
"and advanced features of all sorts.</p>\n"
"<p>You can enable/disable plugins to suit your needs in the configuration "
"dialog,\n"
"choose <strong>Settings -&gt;configure</strong> to launch that.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate ligel gellek optionên firehî tê weşandin, yên ku karê asan û "
"ne asan karin bikin.</p>\n"
"<p>Ev optionên firehî tu kari di pencera çawdêrî vemirîni yan jî "
"pêxi.\n"
"JIbo wê hilbijêre<strong>Danan-&gt; Kate çawdêrî...</strong>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:10
msgid ""
"<p>You can swap the characters on each side of the cursor just by pressing\n"
"<strong>Ctrl+T</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Heger tu bixwazi charaktera çep û rast ji Cursor biguhere\n"
"<strong>Strg+T</strong> dagire.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:15
msgid ""
"<p>You can export the current document as a HTML file, including\n"
"syntax highlighting.</p>\n"
"<p>Just choose <strong>File -&gt; Export -&gt; HTML...</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Livir tu kari Dokumenta aktîv wek HTML-Faîl export bikî, û ti kari\n"
"Lênerînên rengê Textê jî biguhere.</p>\n"
"<p>Jibo vê hilbijêre : <strong>Faîl -&gr; Exportkirin -&gt; "
"HTML...</strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>You can split the Kate editor as many times as you like and\n"
"in either direction. Each frame has its own status bar and\n"
"can display any open document.</p>\n"
"<p>Just choose "
"<br><strong>View -&gt; Split [ Horizontal | Vertical ]</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tu kari pencera dîmenê ji Kate gellek caran jihevdu cihê bike evaya\n"
"estûnî û asoyî jî. Her nîvdîmenek lista statusa xwe heye û kari\n"
"her dokumentek vekkirî pêşkêşbike.</p>\n"
"<p>Jibo vê hilbijêre: "
"<br><strong>Dîmen -&gt; Cihêkirina estûnî/ asoyî </strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:28
msgid ""
"<p>You can drag the Tool views (<em>File List</em> and <em>File "
"Selector</em>)\n"
"to any side that you want them in Kate, or stack them, or even tear them off "
"the\n"
"main window.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tu kari keresta dîmenan bikêşî (<em>Lista faîla</em> û "
"<em>Hilbijartina Faîl</em>)\n"
"li ser her pel û pencerekê Kate, tu kari wan liser hev yan jî komplet "
"jihev azad\n"
" bicîhbike.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:34
msgid ""
"<p>Kate has a build in terminal emulator, just press <strong>F7</strong> to\n"
"show or hide it as you desire.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
" Kate Terminalemulator heye yê ku têde avakirîye, hema ji xwere pê li "
"<strong>F7</strong>,\n"
" bike jibo ku tu wî pêxe yan vemrîne.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p>Kate can highlight the current line with a \n"
"<table bgcolor=\"yellow\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" "
"width=\"100%\"><tr><td>different \n"
"background color.<strong>|</strong></td></tr></table></p>\n"
"<p>You can set the color in the <em>Colors</em> page of the configuration \n"
"dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate kari balkêşîyek rengî bide dêra berdest mîna \n"
"<table bgcolor=\"yellow\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" "
"width=\"100%\"><tr><td>yêndin \n"
"paşereng <strong>|</strong></td></tr></table>pêşkêş bike.</p>\n"
"<p>Evaya kîjani, tu kari di erdê <em>Reng</em> pella Çawdêrî\n"
"sazbike.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:47
msgid ""
"<p>You can open the currently edited file in any other application from "
"within \n"
"Kate.</p>\n"
"<p>Choose <strong>File -&gt; Open With</strong> for the list of programs \n"
"configured\n"
"for the document type. There is also an option <strong>Other...</strong> to "
"\n"
"choose any application on your system.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari neha faîla aktîv ya amadekiri bi applîkationekê ligor "
"daxwazê te ji yên Kate \n"
"vekke.</p>\n"
"<p>Hilbijêre <strong>Faîl -&gt; Vekke bi</strong> jibo listekê ji "
"programên ku , ji vî \n"
"typê Faîl re\n"
"hatine sazkirin. Li wê derê optionek din jî heye "
"<strong>Hinekdin...</strong> jibo \n"
"tu kari bi her applîkationek li ser sîstema xwe hilbijêre.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<p>You can configure the editor to always display the line numbers and/or \n"
"bookmark panes when started from the <strong>View Defaults</strong> page of "
"the\n"
"configuration dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari edîtor wissa sazbike, ku herdem hejmarên dêr Û/Yan \n"
"çarçêwa bookmark bête nîşandan, Evaya li ser Pella<strong>Dîmenên "
"standard</strong> yên \n"
" Dialoga Çawdêrî.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:62
msgid ""
"<p>You can download new or updated <em>Syntax highlight definitions</em> "
"from \n"
"the <strong>Highlighting</strong> page in the configuration dialog.</p>\n"
"<p>Just click the <em>Download...</em> button on the <em>Highlight "
"Modes</em>\n"
"tab (You have to be online, of course...).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Livir tu kari <em>pênaseyên lênerînên syntax</em> yên nuh yan "
"aktualkirî \n"
"bar dabigrî ji <strong>Lênerîn</strong> di Dialoga Çawdêrî de.</p>\n"
"<p> JIbo wilo pê liser Mişkoka <em>dabigrî</em> bike liser Pella "
"<em>Modên Lênerîn</em>\n"
"(Jibo wê divê tu online be).</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<p>You can cycle through all open documents by pressing "
"<strong>Alt+Left</strong> \n"
"or <strong>Alt+Right</strong>. The next/previous document will immediately "
"be displayed \n"
"in the active frame.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari heri ser her Dokumentek vekkirî bi alîkarîya "
"<strong>Alt+Çep</strong> Yan <strong>Alt+Rast</strong> \n"
"Here ser dokumenta bûrî/yatir îca wê ev bête nîşankirin di frame a \n"
"aktîv de.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<p>You can do cool sed-like regular expression replacements using "
"<em>Editing \n"
"Command</em>.</p>\n"
"<p>For example, press <strong>Ctrl+M</strong> and enter "
"<code>s/oldtext/newtext/g</code> \n"
"to replace &quot;oldtext&quot; with &quot;newtext&quot; throughout the "
"current \n"
"line.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tu kari Text têke cihê teteke din de bi Styla SED de, bikar bîne "
"<em>Edîtkirin \n"
"Kommand</em>.</p>\n"
"<p> Exampil pê li <strong>Strg+M</strong> bike binivîse <code>s/texta "
"kevin/texta nuh/g</code> \n"
", jibo ku &quot;texta nuh&quot; cihê &quot;texta kevin &quot; bigre di "
"lînya, ku\n"
"Cursor neha lisere.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:83
msgid ""
"<p>You can repeat your last search by just pressing <strong>F3</strong>, or "
"\n"
"<strong>Shift+F3</strong> if you want to search backwards.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari bang lêgerîna xweî dawî ke, Heger tu pê li "
"<strong>F3</strong> xe jibo lêgerîna bipêşveçûn, yan "
"<strong>Umschalt+F3</strong> jibo Lêgherîna bipaşveçûn.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:88
msgid ""
"<p>You can filter the files displayed in the <em>File Selector</em> tool "
"view. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Simply enter your filter in the filter entry at the bottom, for example: "
"\n"
"<code>*.html *.php</code> if you only want to see HTML and PHP files in the "
"\n"
"current directory.</p>\n"
"<p>The File Selector will even remember your filters for you.</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari Faîlan filterbike, heger tu<em>Faîl hilbijêr</em> TOol "
"dîmen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Bi asanî Filterê xwe li erdêî binî binîvise, Exampil\n"
"<code>*.html *.php</code> Heger tu bitenê HTML- und PHP-Faîlan dixwaze\n"
"bibîne.</p>\n"
"<p>Pencera Faîl hilbijêr filtera te jî diki bîra xwe.</strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:97
msgid ""
"<p>You can have two views - or even more - of the same document in Kate. "
"Editing \n"
"in either will be reflected in both.</p>\n"
"<p>So if you find yourself scrolling up and down to look at text at the "
"other \n"
"end of a document, just press <strong>Ctrl+Shift+T</strong> to split \n"
"horizontally.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari yek yan gellek dîmenan di dokumêntekê di Kate bikarbîne .\n"
"Guhertên di her pencerekê bikî wê bê xwûyakirin.</p>\n"
"<p>Yanî heger tu bixwaze li gellek cîya di dokumentekê de kar bike di "
"katekê(demekê) de \n"
"pê li <strong>Strg+Shift+T</strong> bike, jibodîmen\n"
"asoyî bête cihêkirin.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:105
msgid ""
"<p>Press <strong>F8</strong> or <strong>Shift+F8</strong> to switch to the \n"
"next/previous frame.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pê li <strong>F8</strong> yan <strong>Shift+F8</strong> bike jibo \n"
" tu here ser nîvpencera ya bê yan ya bûrî.</p>\n"

